==================================================
EXECUTION RULE
==================================================

Work phase by phase.

After each phase:
1. Build.
2. Test what was implemented.
3. Fix issues.
4. Report what changed.
5. Continue to the next phase.

Do not jump ahead when a previous phase is broken.

Base functionality and rich-content rendering have priority over bonus features.

If the actual JSON differs from any example in this plan, inspect the JSON and adapt the implementation to the real structure instead of inventing fields.